Subject: [PATCH 19/26] Image B step 2: 0008 SMP CUT fixed for MK1 1.73 (D25)

SOUND0 = 232 + 96 (328): the kit is at project + 232 and kit_track_sound adds
0x60 (96), so cut_process now reads the live sound at Sound_T + 16
(movel %a0@(344),%d0; was %a0@(428), Sound_T + 100). word_sync refuses a
selected track above 11 (the FX track) with d0 = a0 = 0, so delta_gate writes
nothing there (r5b offsets O9 (d), mandatory per its skeptic). The kit + 60
misreading is corrected in the 0008 comment, PORTING.md and symbols.toml.

Guest: make verify (0000 0002 0003 0008), samplefocus and control PASS. Built
bytes: 4868 00e8 (pea %a0@(232)) at 0x402a2db4 and 2028 0158 at 0x402a1cba;
48680160 absent; 202801ac only at stock 0x401178c6. Symbol compare against the
old 0008 build: only word_sync (+guard) and cut_process (the operand) differ.

