0008-sample-cut: page id 12 (CHOP keeps 11); provides_shared, exporting
shared_cut_page_id/page/get/delta/text; own_pages param (default 0): its page
gates and a new lock_gate (ids 1..2 return 0, r5b pages skeptic P8) are built and
detoured only with own_pages = 1, which `make verify` passes.

0001-chop: when 0008 provides them (.ifdef), page_info answers page 12 with
0008's descriptor, and get/delta/text jmp to 0008's handlers for ids 1..2
(chop_ktab K_CUT), which lock_gate answers with 0. Without 0008 nothing of it
is assembled: image A' rebuilds byte for byte (f0220e4c...).

tools/build.py (minimal, per the r5b pages skeptic): build/shared.inc is
deleted at the start and accumulates every provider's exports; a provider
that needs the shared runtime must follow one; 0008 with own_pages = 0 and no
0001-chop is refused. elemod_check builds 0008 with own_pages=1; mkelemod names
page:12. New `make guard-check` proves both refusals.

Guest: samplefocus, chop-min, control, verify, random and guard-check PASS.
The merged dispatch is first assembled in step 4 (samplefocus-cut).

