From dd84b6c8a37ecc3898c5e95d94d7b276669202b5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bandersong <134746909+bandersong@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 14:39:57 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 23/26] Image B step 6 (D29 option 4, part b): image B fits -
 make samplefocus-cut

Image B = 0000-shared (lean) + 0001-chop + 0008-sample-cut (own_pages = 0), tag
0000_0001_0008: guest build and verify PASS, syx 86e1dd1b..., MAIN OS 7fd14fcb....
Pools: cave 1218/1232 B, cave2 2074/2176 B, cave3 1014/1024 B; no cave4..6.

- 0000-shared: param lean (default 0). lean = 1 assembles only shared_rnd,
  shared_sound_of and shared_mark_changed(_set) (140 B, the same instructions)
  in a lean claim at the end of its slot.
- 0001-chop: param shared_lean (default 0): its cave2 .text claim runs on into
  the head of 0000-shared's slot. One layout for image A' and image B, four
  sections: .chst in cave (pad gates, chop_value, the 48 B of state), .text and
  .cave2 in cave2, .cave3 in cave3 (constants only). Excludes 0002, 0003, 0004;
  0008 is no longer excluded, so layout.py checks CHOP against 0008.
  chop_lock_one's two writer calls share one body (the iterator and chop_lay
  never read the d0 it returns).
- 0008-sample-cut: with own_pages = 0 its filter state is its own section
  .cutst in cave (D27) and its page data and strings go to the end of .tab;
  with own_pages = 1 nothing moves (make verify's image is unchanged).
- registry: 0008's own_pages claims are gated; image B claims added.
- tools/mkelemod.py skips a claim, detour or patch its gate leaves out of the
  build it exports from (the gated image-B claims overlap the default ones).
- Makefile: samplefocus-cut; guard-check also refuses shared_lean = 1 with a
  full 0000-shared.

Image A' (make samplefocus, default params): syx 23a20937..., 1448/1464 B in
its cave2 .text claim; against step 5 only chop_lock_one differs after
normalising addressing modes. Unchanged: verify (0d51f7cb...), random
(3dafc0bd...), control (3407638c...); elemod output identical to the old
tooling's. guard-check PASS. Receipts: corp/r7b-builder/b3, b5.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
